    "text": "Overseas Pakistaniyon ne October mein $3.89 billion ghar bheje!\nBusiness Recorder ke mutabiq State Bank of Pakistan (SBP) ne Tuesday ko bataya ke October 2026 mein bahar se aane wali raqam (remittances) $3.89 billion rahi. Yeh pichle saal October ke $3.42 billion se 14% zyada hai. Sab se zyada paisay Saudi Arabia se $982 million aaye, phir UAE se $816 million.\nKya aap ke ghar ka bhi koi bahar kaam karta hai? Comment mein batayein 👇\n\nImage: AI-generated illustration.\n\n#RiseUpPakistan #Remittances #OverseasPakistanis #SBP #PakistanNews",
